Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:06.80,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Uh, all right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:11.57,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Let's begin the Ultra Awesome Sports \NDay Celebration Party (as named by Iko).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:13.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We're doing this \Nat your place, Lemon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.18,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,It's cheaper to drink at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yikes. She's already drinking,\Nso no toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:22.29,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why'd you make us change \Ninto these clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:25.88,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,School rules would be a pain \Nif you were in uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:30.18,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Let's just say you're visiting \Nan older friend today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:33.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,The teachers' exam \Nmust be bugged if she passed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:35.93,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You've got a nice place, Lemon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:38.43,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Who's gonna give the toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who else but yours truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:42.62,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Take it away, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.93,0:00:48.90,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Good job, everyone. \NEspecially you, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:50.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:55.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,A toast to Lemon-chan, \Nwho's paying for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:56.83,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.48,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:01:01.50,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I'm paying? But I'm broke and \Nwaiting for payday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:04.45,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This is punishment \Nfor slacking on advisor work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.45,0:01:06.34,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Thanks for treating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:08.24,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:10.40,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:13.71,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I said to change into something comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.25,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,But you went all-out with those outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:18.65,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Why are you all dressed to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:22.34,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:24.75,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Good for you, Yamabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:27.82,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,You can produce an heir for your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:29.95,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha? What are you trying to say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:35.65,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,You girls must've panicked because \Nsomeone made a proxy confession to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.65,0:01:36.87,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Ah, youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:40.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I-It has nothing to do with him. \NThis is just how I normally dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:43.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-I just grabbed \Nwhatever was nearby, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:47.15,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I just wanted to wear some new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:50.94,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Look at you, making excuses. \NAt least come up with some better ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.94,0:01:52.39,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,And what's your excuse, Rikka?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:58.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I picked this out hoping \NYamabuki-kun would call me cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:02.77,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,You heard her, Yamabuki. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.52,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,He's asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:07.69,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I guess he did run around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:10.22,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I can't believe he fell asleep \Nin a woman's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.91,0:02:12.69,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Too bad for you, Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:14.16,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:19.12,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You let a good chance slip, Yamabuki-kun. \NYou'll never see me in this outfit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.19,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Okay, the odd one's out for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.19,0:02:24.44,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Let's have ourselves a girls-only party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:27.12,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why don't we go buy some food first?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:29.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,How about we each bring \Nsomething we'd like to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:30.89,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:32.49,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What do we do about Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:34.38,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Just put him on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:39.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Your place is fancier \Nthan I expected, Lemon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:43.42,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't know about growing bean \Nsprouts in the bathroom, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:47.56,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that? \NEasy access to water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:11.93,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you something,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.93,0:03:13.81,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,but you had to go and fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:28.13,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Say, why did Shinobu \Nhug you during the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:34.49,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You two have always hit it off. \NAre you dating or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:41.08,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oh, Iko's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:55.92,Main,EPTITLE A SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NENE SAW
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:36.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Have you two kissed and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:43.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hoo boy, I forgot my wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.49,0:05:47.65,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I think I set a new world\Nrecord for being forgetful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:50.09,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,W-Welcome back, Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.12,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:56.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You were here, Iko? \NI just came back to grab my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:57.73,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Are you taking a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.53,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Y-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:01.44,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What'd you buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:03.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:05.96,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:08.26,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Wait, did I just try to get in Iko's way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:13.06,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Why? Because she was gonna kiss him? \NBut it's got nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.02,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:16.90,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:19.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I just got back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:21.61,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I didn't see or hear anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.77,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I dropped my contacts, \Nand my ears are full of fluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:27.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,So, have you ever kissed anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:31.25,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,And here I was trying so hard \Nto change the topic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.87,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:36.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Dunno. Just felt like asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.40,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I have, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.94,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Really? Who? And when?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:44.01,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It was fairly recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.51,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,If that one counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:49.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You're so grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:51.97,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You have, huh? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.38,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,By the way, Iko...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:56.94,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Do you like the errand boy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:06:59.73,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:03.03,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I mean, you were about \Nto kiss him earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:06.06,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You saw that? Y-You big fat liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:07.84,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You said you didn't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:10.33,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I have 20/20 vision!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:12.45,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's your fault for being so careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Whoa, Iko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:24.88,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't think it's like that, but I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:29.13,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I've always been a recluse, \Nso it's the first time I've felt this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:33.38,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Do you have feelings for Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.61,0:07:39.65,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Not really. I really hate all boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But... well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:46.45,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,he's better than the other \Nboys I know, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:49.29,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:50.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.74,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nene-chan? Iko-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:55.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:57.54,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:08:00.46,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Their shoes are here. \NDid they go out in slippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.43,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Guess I'm the first one back, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:05.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Why are we hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:06.67,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:10.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun's still asleep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:15.22,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's too bad. I even bought \Nsomething nice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:17.56,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:20.03,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I owe you two apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:23.78,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,First, I'm sorry for hugging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.78,0:08:26.03,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I thought we were done for,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:29.15,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,so you were basically my savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:31.62,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I hope you didn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:37.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I certainly didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The other thing I must apologize for...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,is lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:48.38,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We're partners in crime, \Nbut there's something I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:50.62,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll fess up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:53.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:55.33,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,back during the confession event...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:56.52,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:58.90,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Nobody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:04.40,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Did they go out in slippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.99,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Why are you two hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:07.01,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:09.29,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding, Shinobu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:10.32,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Guess I'm the first one back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:16.03,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,He's still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:19.83,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Really? I got you something nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.34,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Aw, such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I've gone and changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:44.43,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm sulking 'cause you \Ndidn't compliment me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:47.77,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. You can't hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:57.33,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wow, you're still playing the guitar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:03.05,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm actually writing a song right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:05.67,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But I think I've hit a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:05.67,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.84,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What in the world are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:25.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Crap, I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:33.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with this weird mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:36.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NSurely you're not fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:37.98,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We did fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:38.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.23,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's not why, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.23,0:10:41.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:47.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We agreed to each buy something we like, \Nbut we all bought the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:51.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay, but how'd you all end up \Nbuying whole-ass cakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:53.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did you want to eat cake that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:57.64,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Well, you worked really hard, \Nso I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:01.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I wanted to celebrate our success, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:04.69,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You were tired, so I figured \Nsomething sweet might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:08.44,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I just bought it because I wanted some.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:14.32,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But four cakes is too many, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.35,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,He dug in quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:19.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly just happened to have \Nthe mother of all sugar cravings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:22.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Four cakes might not even \Nbe enough to satisfy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:27.90,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:29.46,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Don't force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:32.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:35.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is what I'd call...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.56,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Rejoice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:40.03,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I bought cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:53.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thank you for the treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:56.44,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I was moved by your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:58.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How many calories was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:11:59.70,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.31,0:12:03.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,No problem at all. That was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:07.10,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Eat my cake next, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:10.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My heart seeks entertainment. \NThis is a celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:13.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Simply eating and drinking \Nwould be a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:14.06,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,He noped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:17.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Something that would bring \Nthe members closer together...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.83,0:12:20.26,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How about we play a game of some sort?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Good idea. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:23.97,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I wanna play Cats'n'Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:25.68,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Do you have any games, Lemon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:29.64,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Well, I do have some stuff \Nfor drinking games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:34.07,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,The loser has to eat this in one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:35.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The devil is among us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:37.66,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't just decide the punishment first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:39.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're joining us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:44.17,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I pass. I avoid carbs past 8 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:48.03,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,And beer doesn't count? \NHow did she become a teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:49.31,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Which one are we playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:52.39,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,This one for sure. \NI don't wanna use my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:53.80,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,And someone's probably good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:59.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Smart. Yours truly hasn't lost a game \Nof Concentration in my 17 years of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:06.85,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's your first turn. Don't overthink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:09.02,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Go for it, Nene-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.03,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Softly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.49,0:13:13.90,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Softly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.95,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.23,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.23,0:13:27.96,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That was quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:29.37,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Me next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:32.33,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't play analog games like this often.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:33.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:36.11,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's exciting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:37.92,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:44.40,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yikes, you're going there already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I upped the difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:49.40,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Taking no prisoners, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:57.30,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What's your move, Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:02.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Am I allowed to touch as many blocks \Nas I want, as many times as I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.43,0:14:03.73,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,What do you say, ref?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:04.83,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Lemon-chan's the ref?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:05.87,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Don't see why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:09.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I have the ref's permission. Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:11.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't poke around too much. \NYou'll make it collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:13.39,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,Oho?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:15.65,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,You're an expert at this, Yamabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:19.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Please. We Yamabukis \Njust play it occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:25.57,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Three blocks on each level. \NFifty-four blocks in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:30.52,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,In this old-school balancing game, \Neach block appears to be the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:33.80,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,but they're slightly different \Nin size and thickness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:36.81,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,So you go for the slightly thinner ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.57,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:50.99,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't get all smug on me! \NYou're pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:53.83,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,He thinks he's got this in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:56.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun's a tough nut to crack, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:59.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, he hasn't noticed I changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.42,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Time to get serious, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:13.98,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Crap. All that cake's making me drowsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:17.61,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,One of these four is Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:16.81,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Will you hurry up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:18.48,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.50,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,How about over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:20.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:21.48,Main,IKKO,0,0,0,,I dunno about that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:21.48,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Long time no talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:27.03,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Back then, it was definitely her \Non the other side of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:30.53,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,What was the deal with \Nthe proxy confession earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:34.33,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I felt like I had to express my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.73,0:15:37.14,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I ran away from my radio show,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:39.92,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,and I guess I'm just sick of hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:42.00,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,While you're at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:44.52,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,why not show yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:46.87,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:49.75,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,What if I said \NI was actually fine with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:53.72,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,That's why I asked you \Nto come here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.48,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:00.86,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:03.95,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've decided to find you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:07.49,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you showed yourself now, \NI would be admitting defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:10.48,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,And that goes against \Nthe Yamabuki family tenets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:13.66,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Besides, I made a promise, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.19,0:16:16.18,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll turn everyone in the club into pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.18,0:16:18.67,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll know who you are \Nby then, like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:22.37,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,You're actually serious about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:25.59,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I don't think that dream's \Ngoing to come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:28.60,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,What are you after, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:31.76,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Did you come here just to find me \Nand make me a pro?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:36.15,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm here for a personal reason. \NI don't want to talk about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.33,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:43.65,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,After hearing all your voices in person, \NI've found myself a new goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:46.62,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I want to get a voice-related job, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:50.22,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Except, I won't be a performer. \NI'll be a producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:53.53,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I want to release songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.77,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I want to produce anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:57.86,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I want to have concerts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.23,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,and create broadcast programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:06.25,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I want to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:10.06,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Like it or not, \NI'll make that dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.91,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,And you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.18,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,You're so self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:18.08,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:20.81,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.81,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,H-Hey, did you just walk out the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.84,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Could you be any more daring?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:40.95,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,That voice was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:42.67,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Errand boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.63,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna space out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:49.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My bad. I was thinking about something...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What on Earth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.99,0:17:55.80,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,If you think you can move a block now, \NI'd love to see you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:57.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How'd it end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.13,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We did our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:00.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You got on our nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:02.56,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,The power of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:07.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't believe you four teamed up \Nto take down yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But is this even allowed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:11.51,Main,LEMON,0,0,0,,I say why not? It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:12.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:15.49,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Remember, Lemon-chan craves \Ninstant gratification above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't say her response \Ncomes as a surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:19.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but I will say this isn't how \Na teacher is supposed to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:22.21,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay, now, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:23.56,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:25.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Though, one touch and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.40,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,it's all o-ver for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:31.01,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I don't know, it might crash on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.41,0:18:34.51,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,My strategy has been nullified.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.25,0:18:39.60,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,In which case, I'll have to \Nmeasure them with my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:25.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:33.49,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That was a good change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:34.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, look at the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:36.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:37.47,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:39.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay, werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.56,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Rawrity-rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:42.67,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Aren't you more of a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:43.62,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:44.94,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You'll wake people up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:48.12,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Apollo, may I say one last thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:56.10,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I was always a fan of yours, \Nand I still am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.75,0:19:58.89,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I got \Nto hear your voice again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:04.38,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,So I'll return the favor and tell you \Nthe same thing I said back then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.03,0:20:07.22,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Arisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:10.36,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:14.09,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:20.37,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I got to hear Apollo's voice \Nin person for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:25.31,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,but I still couldn't identify \Nwhich of these four was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.83,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:31.21,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Today was a bit much, even for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:36.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I had no time to breathe all day. \NI'd be lying if I said I wasn't fatigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.61,0:20:37.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:39.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You all must be just as tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.18,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}TEAM RED - TEAM WHITE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We provided commentary \Nfor all the events,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:44.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,kept the score, and moved things along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:50.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The broadcast club has cleared \Nevery mission we had for sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:52.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We should be proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:57.57,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Quit acting all smug, errand boy. \NDon't take charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:00.07,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:02.22,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We really did pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:06.29,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,The proxy confessions went over well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:07.58,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:09.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but we had fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:11.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You had fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.62,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Of course we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:15.19,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,That was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:17.59,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'd like to do more of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.69,0:21:22.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If you all had fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:25.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,then yeah, it was a huge success!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:31.39,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm glad I went for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:35.66,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nene-chan, Iko-chan, Rikka-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:37.78,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,and Yamabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:40.19,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thank you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:53.30,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:56.45,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.93,Main,EPTITLE C SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'LL CHERISH WHAT YOU JUST SAID FOREVER
